    "title": "Sugar Rush Hits Northlake as Peach Cobbler Factory Moves In - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kendra Davis ,\n1 days ago Dessert fans around Northlake are getting a new excuse to linger near the mall. The Peach Cobbler Factory is setting up shop in Charlotte’s Northcrest retail corridor at 9815 Northlake Centre Parkway, Suite A, with franchisee Rhonda McNutt at the helm. The spot will be the brand’s 13th North Carolina location and another brick in its rapidly expanding Southern dessert empire. Read full article\n1",
